        "original_id": "a4e5c928-68d1-51ea-9817-b3b472a9041a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Xinghua, Jiangsu; Taizhou; Yancheng; Yangzhou; Jingdezhen; Jiangxi; Anhui; China\n- People: Hou Yifan\n- Roles: county-level city; prefecture-level city; Chinese chess grandmaster\n\nFacts:\n- Xinghua is a county-level city under the administration of Taizhou in Jiangsu province, China.\n- Xinghua borders Yancheng to the north and east and Yangzhou to the west.\n- In 2007, Jingdezhen was a prefecture-level city in northeastern Jiangxi province, China, with a total population of 1,554,000.\n- Jingdezhen had previously been a town and borders Anhui to the north.\n- Hou Yifan was born on 27 February 1994 in Xinghua, Jiangsu, China.\n- Hou Yifan is a Chinese chess grandmaster and former chess prodigy.",
